Rule 1 (input tensor and other tensor should have the same size to avoid the RuntimeError: The size of tensor a (0) must match the size of tensor b (4) at non-singleton dimension 0.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
