Rule 5 (input tensor's dtype cannot be complex to prevent 'div_floor_cpu' not implemented error)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10
>>
Rule 7 (if out tensor is provided and its dtype is bool, then input and other dtypes cannot be complex)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_3) = 0 then (dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≠ 10)
