Rule 8 (input and other tensors must have compatible sizes along dimension 0 to avoid size mismatch error)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 0) ∨ (ndim(v_2) = 0)
